  <glossterm>Key success indicator</glossterm>
  <acronym>KSI</acronym>
  <glossdef>
    <simpara>
      A measurable signal used to assess whether a goal, <glossterm linkend="term-value-proposition">value proposition</glossterm>, or project outcome is being achieved.
